\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Example}
\title{Two sites at modulus two}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{Take #{p=2} and #{k=1}, with sites #{0} and #{1}, in the
[fixed-ratio precision](fdip-00BY). The coarse average has
every entry #{1/2}. The precision matrix is
##{\frac{1}{2}\begin{pmatrix}1+m\lambda&m\lambda-1\\
m\lambda-1&1+m\lambda\end{pmatrix}.}
The rescaled class mean sends #{(x(0),x(1))} to
##{\sqrt{\frac{\lambda}{2}}\,\bigl(x(0)+x(1)\bigr).}
The two summands #{\sqrt{\frac{\lambda}{2}}\,x(0)} and
#{\sqrt{\frac{\lambda}{2}}\,x(1)} add to that value.}
